  "change": "Persistent offline import of the four experimental model pins and architecture-specific ORT into app-owned versioned Application Support; no public downloads or qualification flag changes.",
  "contract": [
    "Stage and verify all incoming files before publishing any file",
    "SHA256 plus model size; exact pinned runtime SHA256",
    "Regular owned copies dereference external symlinks; at most one MiB copy buffer",
    "Individual atomic replacements of the same immutable pins preserve valid installs and existing mapped owners",
    "Interrupted new install cannot report ready until the complete set verifies; explicit reimport repairs it",
    "Restore verifies the complete owned set; native loaders also validate bytes",
    "Import and restoration run off main; current revision/cancellation guards prevent stale UI adoption",
    "Same-directory activation preserves loaded model owners; source-context IDs still govern tensor and embedding freshness",
    "Inactive import is refused; successful or rejected import preserves the prior photo phase rather than reporting a failed/closed RAW as ready"
  ],
